  "content": "<p>Themes change how every page looks without touching its content. Pick one to see this same site in it. Use your browser's Back button to return.</p>\n<grid-plate layout=\"1-1-1\">\n  <div slot=\"col-1\">\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=clean-two\"><img src=\"/node_modules/@haxtheweb/haxcms-elements/lib/theme-screenshots/theme-clean-two-thumb.jpg\" alt=\"Clean Two theme\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=clean-two\">Clean Two</a>: course reading</p>\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=polaris-flex-theme\"><img src=\"/node_modules/@haxtheweb/haxcms-elements/lib/theme-screenshots/theme-polaris-flex-theme-thumb.jpg\" alt=\"Polaris Flex theme\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=polaris-flex-theme\">Polaris Flex</a>: department or college site</p>\n  </div>\n  <div slot=\"col-2\">\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=learn-two-theme\"><img src=\"/node_modules/@haxtheweb/haxcms-elements/lib/theme-screenshots/theme-learn-two-theme-thumb.jpg\" alt=\"Learn Two theme\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=learn-two-theme\">Learn Two</a>: training with progress</p>\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=journey-theme\"><img src=\"/node_modules/@haxtheweb/haxcms-elements/lib/theme-screenshots/theme-journey-theme-thumb.jpg\" alt=\"Journey theme\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=journey-theme\">Journey</a>: a guided path</p>\n  </div>\n  <div slot=\"col-3\">\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=resume-theme\"><img src=\"/node_modules/@haxtheweb/haxcms-elements/lib/theme-screenshots/theme-resume-theme-thumb.jpg\" alt=\"Resume theme\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=resume-theme\">Resume</a>: one-off tutorial or profile</p>\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=haxor-slevin\"><img src=\"/node_modules/@haxtheweb/haxcms-elements/lib/theme-screenshots/theme-haxor-slevin-thumb.jpg\" alt=\"Haxor Slevin theme\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\n    <p><a href=\"/?theme=haxor-slevin\">Haxor Slevin</a>: blog</p>\n  </div>\n</grid-plate>\n<p><a href=\"/